  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-4",
   "section": "Iranian nuclear program",
   "text": "With virtually all Israelis agreeing that Iran should be prevented from acquiring nuclear weapons, there is an ongoing bitter debate among policymakers on how best to achieve this goal.",
